(5388342, 773999, 63633, '<td valign="top">Hmm... striking image, but I''m struggling to find the link to the challenge here. Great sharp focus on the teeth.</td>', 'Hmm... striking image, but I''m struggling to find the link to the challenge here. Great sharp focus on the teeth.', '2009-03-18 01:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388344, 774086, 43191, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a flower from the thumbnail! Nice shot.</td>', 'I thought this was a flower from the thumbnail! Nice shot.', '2009-03-18 01:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388345, 774340, 63633, '<td valign="top">I like the scripture reference, but there''s really no need to put them away :) A lot of fun in this image.</td>', 'I like the scripture reference, but there''s really no need to put them away :) A lot of fun in this image.', '2009-03-18 01:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388346, 774168, 96881, '<td valign="top">A long time ago<br/>I like the composition fo this photo, the subject is great for this challenge.  The darkness in the sky at the top of the image though seems a bit fake, especailly against the very light foreground.  I do like the scattered parts around the car.</td>', 'A long time agoI like the composition fo this photo, the subject is great for this challenge.  The darkness in the sky at the top of the image though seems a bit fake, especailly against the very light foreground.  I do like the scattered parts around the car.', '2009-03-18 01:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388348, 774261, 63633, '<td valign="top">I love the colour of your background. I think the lighting on the camera might have benefited from the use of a reflector to light up the side.</td>', 'I love the colour of your background. I think the lighting on the camera might have benefited from the use of a reflector to light up the side.', '2009-03-18 01:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388350, 774358, 63633, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve done well to do this in basic, but I think the exposure on the camera (the link to the challenge really), needs some work.</td>', 'I think you''ve done well to do this in basic, but I think the exposure on the camera (the link to the challenge really), needs some work.', '2009-03-18 01:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388351, 774374, 18403, '<td valign="top">Of course these were all commonplace in my youth, with the possible exception of the Minox "B", though it was often seen in spy thrillers.  I clearly remember Dorothy Collins lisping out "Lucky Thtrike Meanth Fine Tobacco!", a sponsor of "Your Hit Parade" in the mid ''50s.  But she could sing without the lisp!</td>', 'Of course these were all commonplace in my youth, with the possible exception of the Minox "B", though it was often seen in spy thrillers.  I clearly remember Dorothy Collins lisping out "Lucky Thtrike Meanth Fine Tobacco!", a sponsor of "Your Hit Parade" in the mid ''50s.  But she could sing without the lisp!', '2009-03-18 01:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388357, 773899, 18403, '<td valign="top">I have an earlier one of those made by Philips, before the ''miniature'' tubes were made, mine is dated 1942 and is a great old radio!</td>', 'I have an earlier one of those made by Philips, before the ''miniature'' tubes were made, mine is dated 1942 and is a great old radio!', '2009-03-18 01:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388360, 772920, 63633, '<td valign="top">I really love the mood of this... really nostalgic as your title suggests.</td>', 'I really love the mood of this... really nostalgic as your title suggests.', '2009-03-18 01:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388361, 774158, 18403, '<td valign="top">Hey, I''m OLD, but this predates even my excellent memory!  Superb lighting!</td>', 'Hey, I''m OLD, but this predates even my excellent memory!  Superb lighting!', '2009-03-18 01:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388362, 774186, 43191, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection</td>', 'Nice reflection', '2009-03-18 01:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388363, 772861, 43156, '<td valign="top">I like the idea; unfortunately, presentation is not that good; colors are dull and composition is not interesting. That building on the background is very distracting and the black thick border doesnt fit in. 5</td>', 'I like the idea; unfortunately, presentation is not that good; colors are dull and composition is not interesting. That building on the background is very distracting and the black thick border doesnt fit in. 5', '2009-03-18 01:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388369, 773193, 18403, '<td valign="top">Aw come on now, this turkey is not possibly older than 20 years!  Good control of DOF but not a very interesting subject. Still, a decent photo.</td>', 'Aw come on now, this turkey is not possibly older than 20 years!  Good control of DOF but not a very interesting subject. Still, a decent photo.', '2009-03-18 01:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388375, 774254, 18403, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of a sepia-like image and a pleasing presentation.  The abstract background is superb!</td>', 'Excellent use of a sepia-like image and a pleasing presentation.  The abstract background is superb!', '2009-03-18 01:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388377, 774369, 104023, '<td valign="top">Ugh...haven''t forgotten these yet, damn Grad school...Good concept!</td>', 'Ugh...haven''t forgotten these yet, damn Grad school...Good concept!', '2009-03-18 01:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388382, 774080, 18403, '<td valign="top">Terrific lighting, but what is it?</td>', 'Terrific lighting, but what is it?', '2009-03-18 01:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388386, 774318, 43191, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I think I can only just remember milk in a bottle.</td>', 'Great shot. I think I can only just remember milk in a bottle.', '2009-03-18 01:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388388, 774260, 18403, '<td valign="top">Wow!  A mundane object but it really pops with the superb lighting!</td>', 'Wow!  A mundane object but it really pops with the superb lighting!', '2009-03-18 01:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388389, 773548, 43191, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like this very much.</td>', 'Great shot. I like this very much.', '2009-03-18 01:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388394, 774228, 18403, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing a ''58 Caddy and 14 mpg was highway mileage!  Love the perspective!! and the duotone!</td>', 'I''m guessing a ''58 Caddy and 14 mpg was highway mileage!  Love the perspective!! and the duotone!', '2009-03-18 01:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388395, 774356, 18403, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  B&amp;W really makes this image!  I''m guessing a top 10 finish.</td>', 'Whoa!  B&W really makes this image!  I''m guessing a top 10 finish.', '2009-03-18 02:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388398, 773265, 18403, '<td valign="top">Do you mean the 20 Penny nail or the wooden fence?<br/>Very nice DOF and a pleasing composition!</td>', 'Do you mean the 20 Penny nail or the wooden fence?Very nice DOF and a pleasing composition!', '2009-03-18 02:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388399, 774130, 18403, '<td valign="top">Something actually worth remembering!</td>', 'Something actually worth remembering!', '2009-03-18 02:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388400, 773296, 96881, '<td valign="top">Now this is one I don''t remember, either I am not old enough, or we didn''t have these down in Aus<br/>Great Depth of field here.  The bright colours work really well for this.  Prehaps a black background, instead of wood grain, would have really added to this as the wood grain detail is noticable.<br/>Apart from that, a great submission</td>', 'Now this is one I don''t remember, either I am not old enough, or we didn''t have these down in AusGreat Depth of field here.  The bright colours work really well for this.  Prehaps a black background, instead of wood grain, would have really added to this as the wood grain detail is noticable.Apart from that, a great submission', '2009-03-18 02:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388402, 773222, 18403, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!!  The distorted perspective and monotone make this a very surreal image! 9</td>', 'Spectacular!!  The distorted perspective and monotone make this a very surreal image! 9', '2009-03-18 02:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388411, 772920, 18403, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF does not help this image, too much of the subject is out of focus and the light is poor as well. Try facing the subject more toward the center of the frame, but maintain the subject position in the frame.  Then use a smaller aperture to open up the DOF and provide a bit more detail in the background.</td>', 'The shallow DOF does not help this image, too much of the subject is out of focus and the light is poor as well. Try facing the subject more toward the center of the frame, but maintain the subject position in the frame.  Then use a smaller aperture to open up the DOF and provide a bit more detail in the background.', '2009-03-18 02:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388412, 772948, 96881, '<td valign="top">Yes, I remember, and No, I no longer use them......The digital age means few photos are printed.<br/> <br/>The colour and the clutter are both gouing to hurt you here.  I don''t think the clothes in the right or the photo in the left add to the photo, so they are just distractions.  The colours are very flat.  This could have been altered in Post Processing to get some more constrast and vibrance to the photo</td>', 'Yes, I remember, and No, I no longer use them......The digital age means few photos are printed. The colour and the clutter are both gouing to hurt you here.  I don''t think the clothes in the right or the photo in the left add to the photo, so they are just distractions.  The colours are very flat.  This could have been altered in Post Processing to get some more constrast and vibrance to the photo', '2009-03-18 02:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388415, 774006, 18403, '<td valign="top">I don''t believe I have ever seen a better image of a spittoon, but nevertheless it is a spittoon! Terrific lighting!</td>', 'I don''t believe I have ever seen a better image of a spittoon, but nevertheless it is a spittoon! Terrific lighting!', '2009-03-18 02:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388417, 774305, 96881, '<td valign="top">CAD is so much easier.  I can remove that line with a click of the button, instead of scratching it out off the film.<br/> <br/>Simple, elegant, and works really well for me.  I like the light fading to black across the plans.  Maybe the top instrument could have been lit better, but that would have been tricky still geting the fade effect.  I even like the shaddows that have been created.  I think they also add to what you are trying to achieve.</td>', 'CAD is so much easier.  I can remove that line with a click of the button, instead of scratching it out off the film. Simple, elegant, and works really well for me.  I like the light fading to black across the plans.  Maybe the top instrument could have been lit better, but that would have been tricky still geting the fade effect.  I even like the shaddows that have been created.  I think they also add to what you are trying to achieve.', '2009-03-18 02:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388419, 773894, 18403, '<td valign="top">The paper did not care if the printhead was dot matrix or otherwise, but this is tractor feed paper!  Nice use of light and dark to center attention on the subject!</td>', 'The paper did not care if the printhead was dot matrix or otherwise, but this is tractor feed paper!  Nice use of light and dark to center attention on the subject!', '2009-03-18 02:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
