(5388462, 772981, 75958, '<td valign="top">This is a great Portrait, love the lighting and the atmosphere. Don''t understand "The Basement years" maybe I''m too young? but I am not one to DNMC.</td>', 'This is a great Portrait, love the lighting and the atmosphere. Don''t understand "The Basement years" maybe I''m too young? but I am not one to DNMC.', '2009-03-18 02:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388468, 774162, 96881, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I would have been struggling to see the connection here.  Prehaps a more obvious portrayal of Innocence, a pretty frilly ppink dress on her, a different angle, or somehting may have helped.  The result here is a very flat image with very little outside appeal.  The lack of colour, or lighting effects mean it is a rather plain photo</td>', 'Without the title, I would have been struggling to see the connection here.  Prehaps a more obvious portrayal of Innocence, a pretty frilly ppink dress on her, a different angle, or somehting may have helped.  The result here is a very flat image with very little outside appeal.  The lack of colour, or lighting effects mean it is a rather plain photo', '2009-03-18 02:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388476, 774110, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great Artifact.  Wish i had one of those.  The clutter in teh background hurts you in the image though.  Moving it to a place where there was less in the background would have been great.  Also, increasing the contrast on this also woul have helped.  The colours and texture could have been brought out so much more.</td>', 'Great Artifact.  Wish i had one of those.  The clutter in teh background hurts you in the image though.  Moving it to a place where there was less in the background would have been great.  Also, increasing the contrast on this also woul have helped.  The colours and texture could have been brought out so much more.', '2009-03-18 02:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388503, 774369, 63633, '<td valign="top">I sure do.... :)</td>', 'I sure do.... :)', '2009-03-18 03:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388542, 774286, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not in my time, except on the historic railway<br/> <br/>Love the Red in this, it makes the subject jump out from the rest of the image.  A shame about the puddle though.  There is not enough of a reflection for it to add to the image.  The vertical crop I think could have been changed to help.  Some more sky, and less forground a bit could have helped.  Horizontally you are on the rule of thirds, doing it  vertically may have also helped.</td>', 'Not in my time, except on the historic railway Love the Red in this, it makes the subject jump out from the rest of the image.  A shame about the puddle though.  There is not enough of a reflection for it to add to the image.  The vertical crop I think could have been changed to help.  Some more sky, and less forground a bit could have helped.  Horizontally you are on the rule of thirds, doing it  vertically may have also helped.', '2009-03-18 03:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388544, 774044, 96881, '<td valign="top">Well and truly forgotten this one.  The moss, the vines all add to this shot.  A great subject for this challenge.  I think your crop is a little too close.  A little extra room on all sides could have improved this, as it appears very contrained within the border.  Not sure the border is giving you much except adding to the contrained feel</td>', 'Well and truly forgotten this one.  The moss, the vines all add to this shot.  A great subject for this challenge.  I think your crop is a little too close.  A little extra room on all sides could have improved this, as it appears very contrained within the border.  Not sure the border is giving you much except adding to the contrained feel', '2009-03-18 03:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388549, 774131, 96881, '<td valign="top">Never did get milk like this.  Comes from being a little too young, and always getting the overprocessed crap from the supermarket.  The white is good, I like the angle.  For me, a little lighter on the can to make it stand out a touch more from the black background would help, as I feel it is a touch dark overall.  However, with all the different monitors, others might say you are too light.......</td>', 'Never did get milk like this.  Comes from being a little too young, and always getting the overprocessed crap from the supermarket.  The white is good, I like the angle.  For me, a little lighter on the can to make it stand out a touch more from the black background would help, as I feel it is a touch dark overall.  However, with all the different monitors, others might say you are too light.......', '2009-03-18 03:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388565, 774338, 96881, '<td valign="top">Thankfully No<br/> <br/>The crop of this is too close on the right hand side.  I don''t know why you have the bad discolouration in the upper corner of this.  The sky is blown out for much of the scene, as you shot intot he sun, so needed to overexponse the sky to get the toilet lit</td>', 'Thankfully No The crop of this is too close on the right hand side.  I don''t know why you have the bad discolouration in the upper corner of this.  The sky is blown out for much of the scene, as you shot intot he sun, so needed to overexponse the sky to get the toilet lit', '2009-03-18 03:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
