(5388570, 774121, 96881, '<td valign="top">The light from the window is quite harsh, causing shaddows on the far side of her face and hands.  The crop is very restrictive and the pose appears awkward, like maybe she isn''t holding the camera correctly.</td>', 'The light from the window is quite harsh, causing shaddows on the far side of her face and hands.  The crop is very restrictive and the pose appears awkward, like maybe she isn''t holding the camera correctly.', '2009-03-18 03:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
