(5388590, 774342, 96881, '<td valign="top">And you are going to have tears<br/>Great idea for this one.  Like what you have tried to achieve.<br/>However, as the car is a major element in this photo, I think it is too far in the corner.  it needed to be, both horizontally and vertically, closer to the centre (actually, closer to the thirds line really)  This then would have made it the second focal point for the photo, rather than being right in the corner........</td>', 'And you are going to have tearsGreat idea for this one.  Like what you have tried to achieve.However, as the car is a major element in this photo, I think it is too far in the corner.  it needed to be, both horizontally and vertically, closer to the centre (actually, closer to the thirds line really)  This then would have made it the second focal point for the photo, rather than being right in the corner........', '2009-03-18 03:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
