(5390111, 773246, 64929, '<td valign="top">Definitely my favorite of the challenge!<br/>I adore classic/antique cars and you''ve done great justice to the beauty of chrome!  Awesome processing too!</td>', 'Definitely my favorite of the challenge!I adore classic/antique cars and you''ve done great justice to the beauty of chrome!  Awesome processing too!', '2009-03-18 16:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5390113, 773771, 27373, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  The light clouds behind it help make the shot.  I''d like to see it with a little more space at the front (gotta give it some place to go).<br/> <br/>The picky airplane buff stuff:  This one couldn''t have been in the raid on Tokyo.  Its a B25J (J versions weren''t built until 1944).  Doolittles boys flew B25Bs  (different engines and the upper turret is located further back)  :)</td>', 'Nice capture.  The light clouds behind it help make the shot.  I''d like to see it with a little more space at the front (gotta give it some place to go). The picky airplane buff stuff:  This one couldn''t have been in the raid on Tokyo.  Its a B25J (J versions weren''t built until 1944).  Doolittles boys flew B25Bs  (different engines and the upper turret is located further back)  :)', '2009-03-18 16:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
