(5392515, 773941, 96881, '<td valign="top">Is it????<br/>For this type of photo, which is an opportunist shot, and not something set up, you have done well.  The light is pretty good (a few minor issues) but its not like you are in a studio.  Same with the person in the bg as well.<br/>Good opportunist shot</td>', 'Is it????For this type of photo, which is an opportunist shot, and not something set up, you have done well.  The light is pretty good (a few minor issues) but its not like you are in a studio.  Same with the person in the bg as well.Good opportunist shot', '2009-03-19 22:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392517, 774055, 96881, '<td valign="top">Now, I like the idea, I like the Red Light, the books, the Film.  Maybe they could have been arranged in a more interesting way though, some more film spread around or something just to give this a little extra kick.  This is especially the case as you can''t use colour to give it this.....</td>', 'Now, I like the idea, I like the Red Light, the books, the Film.  Maybe they could have been arranged in a more interesting way though, some more film spread around or something just to give this a little extra kick.  This is especially the case as you can''t use colour to give it this.....', '2009-03-19 22:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392520, 774003, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not really sure how this is fitting in with this challenge.  I see these all the time.<br/>The front wing is very overexposed, the deatil sis lost in it, as is the rear of the back wing.  I don''t like the rear wing being cropped out.</td>', 'Not really sure how this is fitting in with this challenge.  I see these all the time.The front wing is very overexposed, the deatil sis lost in it, as is the rear of the back wing.  I don''t like the rear wing being cropped out.', '2009-03-19 22:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392522, 773931, 96881, '<td valign="top">A very flat image, but that is the look that I think you were going for, and it suits the type of image and what you are trying to say here, so it works.  She is a little too centred for me.  I feel you needed to crop out the right hand side, have her sitting on the third line, the sheep than through the picture, with some space to the left showing where she is walking towards.  Shooting further along the path (ie captureing further to the left) could have reqally made a massive difference here, and got you a really good score.</td>', 'A very flat image, but that is the look that I think you were going for, and it suits the type of image and what you are trying to say here, so it works.  She is a little too centred for me.  I feel you needed to crop out the right hand side, have her sitting on the third line, the sheep than through the picture, with some space to the left showing where she is walking towards.  Shooting further along the path (ie captureing further to the left) could have reqally made a massive difference here, and got you a really good score.', '2009-03-19 22:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
