(5392905, 772920, 70270, '<td valign="top">Not only have you captured something forgotten, you''ve done a great job in recreating a Polaroid image through your processing.  Best in the challenge.  10.  Good luck!</td>', 'Not only have you captured something forgotten, you''ve done a great job in recreating a Polaroid image through your processing.  Best in the challenge.  10.  Good luck!', '2009-03-20 09:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392906, 774201, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, tack sharp, good colors and tones.  Expect to see this one on the front page.</td>', 'Nice set up, tack sharp, good colors and tones.  Expect to see this one on the front page.', '2009-03-20 09:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392907, 774228, 70270, '<td valign="top">Like then processing here, really fits the image and time period.  8</td>', 'Like then processing here, really fits the image and time period.  8', '2009-03-20 09:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392931, 774356, 17507, '<td valign="top">this is great! I love the framing, and the high detail plus the flat look of the photo gives it an old-timey feel that really works. Looks like it could be a photo from a 1950s National Geographic.</td>', 'this is great! I love the framing, and the high detail plus the flat look of the photo gives it an old-timey feel that really works. Looks like it could be a photo from a 1950s National Geographic.', '2009-03-20 10:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392932, 774253, 17507, '<td valign="top">Montreal! I was just there.</td>', 'Montreal! I was just there.', '2009-03-20 10:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392934, 774157, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great photo. The high contrast really works, and I always like the high-detail wide-angle shots that give a real sense of perspective. The border puts me off, though, especially because it reminds me of a modern movie played on a 4:3 screen--not so consistent with the forgotten/old-timey theme of this challenge.</td>', 'Great photo. The high contrast really works, and I always like the high-detail wide-angle shots that give a real sense of perspective. The border puts me off, though, especially because it reminds me of a modern movie played on a 4:3 screen--not so consistent with the forgotten/old-timey theme of this challenge.', '2009-03-20 10:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392937, 773548, 17507, '<td valign="top">The gentleman in the middle is perfect. I love the tension created by his dapper apparel and dance-like posture in contrast with his dark eyes and serious expression.</td>', 'The gentleman in the middle is perfect. I love the tension created by his dapper apparel and dance-like posture in contrast with his dark eyes and serious expression.', '2009-03-20 10:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392939, 774086, 17507, '<td valign="top">Haha. I chuckled at this one. I was critical of another photo for its top/bottom framing, but it works for me here, I think because of the stark geometric composition of the photo itself.</td>', 'Haha. I chuckled at this one. I was critical of another photo for its top/bottom framing, but it works for me here, I think because of the stark geometric composition of the photo itself.', '2009-03-20 10:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5392956, 774057, 103989, '<td valign="top">Cameo''s are beautiful. I love the form of the girl, how she''s in contrast with the rest of the picture [including the background]. The bottom of the necklace looks out of focus, but overall a good photo.</td>', 'Cameo''s are beautiful. I love the form of the girl, how she''s in contrast with the rest of the picture [including the background]. The bottom of the necklace looks out of focus, but overall a good photo.', '2009-03-20 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
