(5394285, 774305, 102394, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this, but my eye is being drawn a bit to the heavy shadows.  Still a great photo - nice interpretation and composition.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this, but my eye is being drawn a bit to the heavy shadows.  Still a great photo - nice interpretation and composition.', '2009-03-21 12:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394288, 773543, 50357, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and so fitting for the challenge. 7</td>', 'Nicely done and so fitting for the challenge. 7', '2009-03-21 12:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394289, 774262, 50357, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail.  7</td>', 'Very nice detail.  7', '2009-03-21 12:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394290, 773981, 102394, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo, I like the angle &amp; the crop.  The focus seems just a bit too soft.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo, I like the angle & the crop.  The focus seems just a bit too soft.', '2009-03-21 12:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394291, 773421, 50357, '<td valign="top">This is very nice- 8</td>', 'This is very nice- 8', '2009-03-21 12:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394292, 773862, 50357, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2009-03-21 12:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394293, 774155, 102394, '<td valign="top">It seems a little flat.  The lamp is really cool, but it just doesn''t pop.  Still - the composition is good, and I like the angle and crop.</td>', 'It seems a little flat.  The lamp is really cool, but it just doesn''t pop.  Still - the composition is good, and I like the angle and crop.', '2009-03-21 12:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394294, 774130, 102394, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  You''ve caught a lot of emotion and action without it looking random.  I think the face of the woman in the front is an anchor for the crowd, which pulls it all together.</td>', 'Nice job.  You''ve caught a lot of emotion and action without it looking random.  I think the face of the woman in the front is an anchor for the crowd, which pulls it all together.', '2009-03-21 12:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394296, 773246, 50357, '<td valign="top">Great car! Nicely done!  7</td>', 'Great car! Nicely done!  7', '2009-03-21 12:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394298, 774339, 102394, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. There''s a lot to look at, but I couldn''t name one thing that''s distracting.  The only thing I would change is the lighting.  It looks as though it was taken with natural light during the day.  Unfortunately, I think it''s just a bit too bright.  Still a great photo!</td>', 'I love this photo. There''s a lot to look at, but I couldn''t name one thing that''s distracting.  The only thing I would change is the lighting.  It looks as though it was taken with natural light during the day.  Unfortunately, I think it''s just a bit too bright.  Still a great photo!', '2009-03-21 12:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394309, 774057, 102394, '<td valign="top">This is really simple and pretty.  However, the lighting is washing out the portrait, and reflecting too much on the metal which exaggerates the soft focus. The detail on it is beautiful - I don''t think it needs a soft focus.</td>', 'This is really simple and pretty.  However, the lighting is washing out the portrait, and reflecting too much on the metal which exaggerates the soft focus. The detail on it is beautiful - I don''t think it needs a soft focus.', '2009-03-21 12:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394311, 773894, 102394, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I love the abstract look and feel of this.  Great photo.</td>', 'Very cool.  I love the abstract look and feel of this.  Great photo.', '2009-03-21 12:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394312, 774157, 102394, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that the tractor is the focus of the photo.  In that case, my suggestion would be to change up the angle on it, or crop in tighter - the rest of the landscape are distracting from it.  I can see why it would be your subject.  It''s really cool.</td>', 'I''m guessing that the tractor is the focus of the photo.  In that case, my suggestion would be to change up the angle on it, or crop in tighter - the rest of the landscape are distracting from it.  I can see why it would be your subject.  It''s really cool.', '2009-03-21 12:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394316, 774342, 102394, '<td valign="top">The best part of this photo is that it tells a complete story even without the title.  Fantastic job.  The focus on the bear with the car almost out of the frame makes it all click.  10</td>', 'The best part of this photo is that it tells a complete story even without the title.  Fantastic job.  The focus on the bear with the car almost out of the frame makes it all click.  10', '2009-03-21 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394318, 773987, 102394, '<td valign="top">Great job.  I love the touches like the hat pushed back and the papers blown against the booth - it gives a kind of forlorn look to it - stranded in the rain or something along those lines.</td>', 'Great job.  I love the touches like the hat pushed back and the papers blown against the booth - it gives a kind of forlorn look to it - stranded in the rain or something along those lines.', '2009-03-21 12:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394320, 773461, 102394, '<td valign="top">I think you did a great job on the lamp itself, but the niche/window/shelf that it is on takes away from it.  It''s so dark behind it, but the wall is so white it''s distracting. I think you could have cropped a lot of the extra window out, changed the angle slightly, and it would make a huge difference in making the lamp ''pop''.</td>', 'I think you did a great job on the lamp itself, but the niche/window/shelf that it is on takes away from it.  It''s so dark behind it, but the wall is so white it''s distracting. I think you could have cropped a lot of the extra window out, changed the angle slightly, and it would make a huge difference in making the lamp ''pop''.', '2009-03-21 12:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394322, 774188, 102394, '<td valign="top">The only thing I would do differently on this would be to deepen the shadows just a bit.  That light beam is fantastic.  Love it!</td>', 'The only thing I would do differently on this would be to deepen the shadows just a bit.  That light beam is fantastic.  Love it!', '2009-03-21 12:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394446, 774293, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the rollers being so obvious.  Would have liked a little more context; more of the what I assume to be a saddle.</td>', 'Liked the rollers being so obvious.  Would have liked a little more context; more of the what I assume to be a saddle.', '2009-03-21 16:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394447, 774108, 104518, '<td valign="top">Is there some way to emphasize the stick shift and fade the rest?</td>', 'Is there some way to emphasize the stick shift and fade the rest?', '2009-03-21 16:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394448, 774059, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the lines and the color.</td>', 'Liked the lines and the color.', '2009-03-21 16:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394449, 774356, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the framing, I feel like I''m almost spying on them.  Would have liked more detail of the birds.</td>', 'Liked the framing, I feel like I''m almost spying on them.  Would have liked more detail of the birds.', '2009-03-21 16:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394452, 774374, 104518, '<td valign="top">I savvy your story. Maybe could have been less centered.</td>', 'I savvy your story. Maybe could have been less centered.', '2009-03-21 16:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394455, 773941, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the "stare".  Might have given him a little more room to stare at something.</td>', 'Liked the "stare".  Might have given him a little more room to stare at something.', '2009-03-21 17:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394456, 774332, 59740, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure and toning.</td>', 'Very nice exposure and toning.', '2009-03-21 17:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394457, 774247, 104518, '<td valign="top">Interesting comment in these times of high unemployment (and I didn''t say it is cold).  Seems awfully centered.</td>', 'Interesting comment in these times of high unemployment (and I didn''t say it is cold).  Seems awfully centered.', '2009-03-21 17:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394458, 773987, 59740, '<td valign="top">Terrific.</td>', 'Terrific.', '2009-03-21 17:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394462, 773911, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the composition.  Focus on the sign could have made the "East" easier to read.</td>', 'Liked the composition.  Focus on the sign could have made the "East" easier to read.', '2009-03-21 17:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394463, 773861, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the alignment of the head to the picture.  Might have made it a little more off center.</td>', 'Liked the alignment of the head to the picture.  Might have made it a little more off center.', '2009-03-21 17:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394464, 773066, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the just enough contrast to find the nail.  Seems a little too centered.</td>', 'Liked the just enough contrast to find the nail.  Seems a little too centered.', '2009-03-21 17:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394465, 774079, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the colors and the light on the tree.  Might be a little too centered.</td>', 'Liked the colors and the light on the tree.  Might be a little too centered.', '2009-03-21 17:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394467, 773810, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the contrasting black on white and white on black.  Would have like it a little more off center.</td>', 'Liked the contrasting black on white and white on black.  Would have like it a little more off center.', '2009-03-21 17:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394469, 773939, 104518, '<td valign="top">Started not to, then I liked the lack of surrounding detail - is it in a shop to be renovated? Is it on the way to the crusher? Could the flash reflection in the headlamps be reduced?</td>', 'Started not to, then I liked the lack of surrounding detail - is it in a shop to be renovated? Is it on the way to the crusher? Could the flash reflection in the headlamps be reduced?', '2009-03-21 17:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394470, 774162, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the ''recent'' perfectly coifed hair.  Are her lips really that rosy?  Or did mom insist on a little lipstick?</td>', 'Liked the ''recent'' perfectly coifed hair.  Are her lips really that rosy?  Or did mom insist on a little lipstick?', '2009-03-21 17:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394476, 774332, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the detail of being able to see that the box is made of wood.  Reserve the right to make a constructive comment when I learn more.  Only have a title editing note: Operator: "Can I help you?"</td>', 'Liked the detail of being able to see that the box is made of wood.  Reserve the right to make a constructive comment when I learn more.  Only have a title editing note: Operator: "Can I help you?"', '2009-03-21 17:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394478, 773738, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the composition. I thought the bright light gave it too much glare.</td>', 'Liked the composition. I thought the bright light gave it too much glare.', '2009-03-21 17:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394480, 773434, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the worn look on the pull tab.  Could have been offset.</td>', 'Liked the worn look on the pull tab.  Could have been offset.', '2009-03-21 17:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5394487, 773066, 104643, '<td valign="top">Fascinating photo, great close-up, but I can''t help but wonder what is in the faded background.</td>', 'Fascinating photo, great close-up, but I can''t help but wonder what is in the faded background.', '2009-03-21 17:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
