(5399473, 774086, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice clean simple image, although a little more light may have brought this out more.<br/> <br/>A good choice of subject though, there used to be entire corporations run on those things !</td>', 'Nice clean simple image, although a little more light may have brought this out more. A good choice of subject though, there used to be entire corporations run on those things !', '2009-03-25 04:43:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5399477, 774185, 68586, '<td valign="top">For me this shot is made by it''s title - it''s a great quote that draws the viewer in to seek further understanding and take in the component parts of the picture, the elderly gentleman walking on his own lost in thought (memories ?), with the wonderful counterpoint of a fictional woman and child on the wall next to him making a ''virtual'' family, all going in the same direction. It is as though his thoughts, dreams and memories are being enacted out on a screen next to him . . a further poignancy is that while he and his surroundings are muted bland colours - his ''dream'' is bright and vibrant, full of energy and life.<br/> <br/>Very powerful</td>', 'For me this shot is made by it''s title - it''s a great quote that draws the viewer in to seek further understanding and take in the component parts of the picture, the elderly gentleman walking on his own lost in thought (memories ?), with the wonderful counterpoint of a fictional woman and child on the wall next to him making a ''virtual'' family, all going in the same direction. It is as though his thoughts, dreams and memories are being enacted out on a screen next to him . . a further poignancy is that while he and his surroundings are muted bland colours - his ''dream'' is bright and vibrant, full of energy and life. Very powerful', '2009-03-25 04:51:30.000000', NULL, 0),
