(5399558, 774213, 15832, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Mephisto:</b></div><hr/><i> dude, grats on the blue, cool shot!<br/>that''s near reykholt with Ok in the background isn''t it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks... Actually its just down here by the river where the old  abandoned Stable is. O.K is there but you cant see it for the clouds. But if you look closer  you can see the canyon Rauðsgil ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Mephisto: dude, grats on the blue, cool shot!that''s near reykholt with Ok in the background isn''t it?   Thanks... Actually its just down here by the river where the old  abandoned Stable is. O.K is there but you cant see it for the clouds. But if you look closer  you can see the canyon Rauðsgil ;) ', '2009-03-25 05:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
