(5399910, 774071, 96924, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nzbayleys:</b></div><hr/><i> Were the fishermen small... or just their boats? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>They are about the same size as small businessmen. Too big for you to understand.</td>', 'Originally posted by nzbayleys: Were the fishermen small... or just their boats?   They are about the same size as small businessmen. Too big for you to understand.', '2009-03-25 09:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5399917, 774071, 96924, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by atmcmurray:</b></div><hr/><i> shame about the glare </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I looked at the scene with my naked eye and I saw a glare on the water and nice light on the boats. Then I looked through my viewfinder and I saw a glare on the water and nice light on the boats. Then I took the photo. I looked at it and I saw a glare on the water and nice light on the boats - captured just as I wanted. Then I cropped a bit - and there it was. I was happy.<br/> <br/>Now I know you grade 2 teacher told you something about glare in a photo........</td>', 'Originally posted by atmcmurray: shame about the glare   I looked at the scene with my naked eye and I saw a glare on the water and nice light on the boats. Then I looked through my viewfinder and I saw a glare on the water and nice light on the boats. Then I took the photo. I looked at it and I saw a glare on the water and nice light on the boats - captured just as I wanted. Then I cropped a bit - and there it was. I was happy. Now I know you grade 2 teacher told you something about glare in a photo........', '2009-03-25 09:32:15.000000', NULL, 0),
